#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – tipkovnica Anax za Android"

#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid ""
"Swajp – swipe keyboard for Android, no internet access, offline dictation."
msgstr ""
"Swajp – tipkovnica s potegi za Android, brez dostopa do interneta, narekovanje brez povezave."

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Domov"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Jeziki"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Zasebnost"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Licence"

#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – tipkovnica Anax"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Tipkovnica,<br><em>vredna cesarja.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr ""
"Hitra kot Anax imperator – veliki spremljevalec.<br>Natančna kot njegov lov."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Navdihnil jo je Swype. Rodila se je kot Swajp.</strong> Tipkovnica za Android, na kateri pišeš s potegom prsta. Besede ugiba iz sobesedila, uči se tvojega sloga, vsi tvoji podatki pa ostanejo v telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Coming soon to Google Play"
msgstr "Kmalu na Google Play"

#: index languages
msgid "Language packs"
msgstr "Jezikovni paketi"

#: index
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: index
msgid "Swipe typing"
msgstr "Pisanje s potegom"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the letters and the word appears."
msgstr "Podrsaj čez črke in beseda se prikaže."

#: index
msgid "Word prediction"
msgstr "Predvidevanje besed"

#: index
msgid "Suggests the next word from what you type."
msgstr "Predlaga naslednjo besedo glede na to, kar pišeš."

#: index
msgid "Gestures & text editing"
msgstr "Kretnje in urejanje besedila"

#: index
msgid "Copy, paste, undo and select with one swipe."
msgstr "Kopiraj, prilepi, razveljavi in označi z enim potegom."

#: index
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emodžiji"

#: index
msgid "Type a word and the emoji flies in."
msgstr "Napiši besedo in emodži prileti."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once, 35 in total."
msgstr "Dva jezika hkrati, skupaj 35."

#: index
msgid "Offline dictation"
msgstr "Narekovanje brez povezave"

#: index
msgid "Speech to text right on your phone."
msgstr "Govor v besedilo kar v telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Clipboard history"
msgstr "Zgodovina odložišča"

#: index
msgid "Your last 30 copied texts at hand."
msgstr "Zadnjih 30 kopiranih besedil pri roki."

#: index
msgid "Number pad & calculator"
msgstr "Številčnica in kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Big digits, a calculator and a scientific one."
msgstr "Velike številke, kalkulator in še znanstveni."

#: index
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Varnostna kopija"

#: index
msgid "Take your learned words to your new phone."
msgstr "Naučene besede preneseš v nov telefon."

#: index
msgid "No internet, no ads, no tracking."
msgstr "Brez interneta, brez oglasov, brez sledenja."

#: index
msgid "Glide over the keys like a dragonfly."
msgstr "Drsi po tipkah kot kačji pastir."

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Prejšnji"

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Naslednji"

#: index
msgid ""
"No need to tap letter by letter – one stroke across the letters of a word is enough. Swajp recognises the swipe even when it is not perfect, and learns your style so it keeps getting more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Ni ti treba tipkati črko za črko – dovolj je en poteg čez črke besede. Swajp prepozna poteg, tudi ko ni popoln, in se uči tvojega sloga, zato je vedno natančnejši."

#: index
msgid "Predicts your next word like a dragonfly predicts its prey."
msgstr "Predvidi tvojo naslednjo besedo, kot kačji pastir predvidi let plena."

#: index
msgid ""
"From the words before, it suggests what you are likely to type next, and uses context to tell similar words apart. It learns the words you actually use."
msgstr ""
"Iz prejšnjih besed predlaga, kaj boš verjetno napisal naprej, in iz sobesedila loči podobne besede. Uči se besed, ki jih res uporabljaš."

#: index
msgid "Rules the air. Now rules your text."
msgstr "Vlada zraku. Zdaj vlada tudi tvojemu besedilu."

#: index
msgid ""
"It flies backwards and forwards too – undo and redo, up to 60 steps. Moving the cursor to select or delete text is as precise as landing on a reed. Copy, paste, cut and select all with a swipe from the Swajp key, change case with a single gesture."
msgstr ""
"Leti tudi nazaj in naprej – razveljavi in ponovi, do 60 korakov. Premik kazalke za označevanje ali brisanje besedila je natančen kot pristanek na bilki. Kopiraj, prilepi, izreži in izberi vse s potegom s tipke Swajp, velikost črk pa spremeni z eno kretnjo."

#: index
msgid ""
"All gestures with demos and practice are in the app: Settings → Gestures and guide."
msgstr ""
"Vse kretnje s prikazi in preizkusom najdeš v aplikaciji: Nastavitve → Kretnje in vodič."

#: index
msgid "Catch your emotion mid-air."
msgstr "Ujemi čustvo v letu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Swipe or type a word – like “heart”, “beer” or “sad” – and Swajp offers the emoji in the suggestion bar. The :) shortcut works too, or simply pick one from the list."
msgstr ""
"S potegom ali tapkanjem napiši besedo – na primer „srce“, „pivo“ ali „žalosten“ – in Swajp ti v vrstici predlogov ponudi emodži. Deluje tudi okrajšava :), lahko pa ga preprosto izbereš s seznama."

#: index
msgid "Born to rule – in 35 languages."
msgstr "Rojena, da vlada – v 35 jezikih."

#: index
msgid ""
"Type in two languages without switching – the keyboard knows words from both. 9 languages are built in (English in two variants), 26 more can be downloaded as packs."
msgstr ""
"Piši v dveh jezikih brez preklapljanja – tipkovnica pozna besede iz obeh. 9 jezikov je vgrajenih (angleščina v dveh različicah), še 26 jih lahko preneseš kot pakete."

#: index
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Green</span> languages are built in, the others can be <a href=\"languages.html\">downloaded as packs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Zeleno</span> označeni jeziki so vgrajeni, ostale lahko <a href=\"languages.html\">preneseš kot pakete</a>."

#: index
msgid "Hears you. Tells no one."
msgstr "Sliši te. Nikomur ne pove."

#: index
msgid ""
"Speech is turned into text right on your phone (Parakeet and Omnilingual models), with no internet. If you like, you can use Google recognition instead. Recognised words are checked against the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Govor se pretvori v besedilo kar v telefonu (modela Parakeet in Omnilingual), brez interneta. Če želiš, lahko namesto tega uporabiš Googlovo prepoznavanje. Prepoznane besede se preverijo po slovarju."

#: index
msgid "Remembers your copies. Forgets your secrets."
msgstr "Zapomni si, kar kopiraš. Skrivnosti pozabi."

#: index
msgid ""
"Your last 30 copied texts are always at hand. Passwords, codes and text marked as sensitive are never stored, and the history clears itself after the time you choose."
msgstr ""
"Zadnjih 30 kopiranih besedil imaš vedno pri roki. Gesla, kode in besedila, označena kot občutljiva, se nikoli ne shranijo, zgodovina pa se sama počisti po času, ki ga izbereš."

#: index
msgid "Even sharp minds reach for a calculator."
msgstr "Tudi bistra glava rada seže po kalkulatorju."

#: index
msgid ""
"Big digits for quick entry of phone numbers and amounts. A calculator and a scientific calculator right in the keyboard – no switching apps."
msgstr ""
"Velike številke za hiter vnos telefonskih številk in zneskov. Kalkulator in znanstveni kalkulator kar v tipkovnici – brez preklapljanja med aplikacijami."

#: index
msgid ""
"A dragonfly can cross the sea. Your learned words and typing style can cross to your new phone."
msgstr ""
"Kačji pastir lahko preleti morje. Tvoje naučene besede in slog pisanja lahko preletijo v nov telefon."

#: index
msgid ""
"Settings, your own words and everything Swajp has learned from your typing go into a single file – load it on your new phone and Swajp types like yours right away. The file stays with you: nothing goes over the internet or to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve, lastne besede in vse, kar se je Swajp naučil iz tvojega pisanja, shraniš v eno datoteko – naloži jo v novem telefonu in Swajp tam takoj piše kot tvoj. Datoteka ostane pri tebi: nič ne gre prek interneta ali v oblak."

#: index
msgid "You’re the hunter, never the prey."
msgstr "Ti si lovec, nikoli plen."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Zero tracking, maximum privacy. </strong>Swajp has no internet permission. Nothing you type or dictate offline can leave your phone. No ads, no analytics. Nothing is learned or stored in password fields."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nič sledenja, največ zasebnosti. </strong>Swajp nima dovoljenja za dostop do interneta. Nič, kar napišeš ali nareknaš brez povezave, ne more zapustiti telefona. Brez oglasov, brez analitike. V poljih za gesla se nič ne uči in nič ne shrani."

#: index
msgid "Privacy policy →"
msgstr "Pravilnik o zasebnosti →"

#: index
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o1\">They say when a dragonfly lands on you, change is coming into your life.</span>Let this one land on your fingertips."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o1\">Pravijo, da ko nate sede kačji pastir, v tvoje življenje prihaja sprememba.</span>Naj ta sede na konice tvojih prstov."

#: languages
msgid "Swajp – language packs"
msgstr "Swajp – jezikovni paketi"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Languages that are not built into the app can be added as a pack. It is a plain zip with a dictionary – nothing gets installed and the app needs no internet for it."
msgstr ""
"Jezike, ki niso vgrajeni v aplikacijo, lahko dodaš kot paket. To je navaden zip s slovarjem – nič se ne namesti in aplikacija za to ne potrebuje interneta."

#: languages
msgid "How to add a pack"
msgstr "Kako dodati paket"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Download the zip of the language you want. It is saved to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "Prenesi zip želenega jezika. Shrani se v mapo Prenosi."

#: languages
msgid "Open <b>Swajp → Settings → Languages → More languages (packs)</b>."
msgstr "Odpri <b>Swajp → Nastavitve → Jeziki → Dodatni jeziki (paketi)</b>."

#: languages
msgid ""
"Tap <b>Import language packs (one or more)</b> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Tapni <b>Uvozi jezikovne pakete (enega ali več)</b> in izberi preneseno datoteko."

#: languages
msgid "Select the new language as your main or second language."
msgstr "Novi jezik izberi kot glavni ali drugi jezik."

